    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Service configuration",
      "source_hash": 4040869980113541407,
      "context_hash": 3019777441230286182,
      "translation": "서비스 구성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030575Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Crater agents are servers with our standard configuration running a Docker container hosting the agent.",
      "source_hash": 6641374641908741010,
      "context_hash": 268172725120895190,
      "translation": "Crater 에이전트는 에이전트를 호스팅하는 Docker 컨테이너를 실행하는, 표준 구성을 갖춘 서버입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Crater": "Crater"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:39.513765Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "A timer checks for updates every 5 minutes, and if a newer Docker image is present the container will automatically be updated and restarted.",
      "source_hash": 11056622496152024069,
      "context_hash": 6608648917016622275,
      "translation": "타이머가 5분마다 업데이트를 확인하며, 더 새로운 Docker 이미지가 있으면 컨테이너가 자동으로 업데이트되고 재시작됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030575Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "This service is [managed with Ansible][ansible].",
      "source_hash": 1786112549312739275,
      "context_hash": 8555789488013458692,
      "translation": "이 서비스는 [Ansible로 관리됩니다][ansible].",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030575Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Common maintenance procedures",
      "source_hash": 1250972913712992444,
      "context_hash": 18409960690064061900,
      "translation": "일반적인 유지보수 절차",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030576Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Starting and stopping the agent",
      "source_hash": 4380974306377520240,
      "context_hash": 2748117134546333957,
      "translation": "에이전트 시작 및 중지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030576Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The agent is managed by the `container-crater-agent.service` systemd unit.",
      "source_hash": 1487241721208606781,
      "context_hash": 2612658558969907793,
      "translation": "에이전트는 `container-crater-agent.service` systemd 유닛에 의해 관리됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030576Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "That means it's possible to start, stop and restart it with the usual systemctl commands:",
      "source_hash": 18083059156874321423,
      "context_hash": 3928144068061681964,
      "translation": "이는 일반적인 systemctl 명령으로 에이전트를 시작, 중지, 재시작할 수 있음을 의미합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030576Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Inspecting the logs of the agent",
      "source_hash": 10093588461217091984,
      "context_hash": 3069251262435474579,
      "translation": "에이전트 로그 확인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030576Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Logs of the agents are forwarded and collected by journald.",
      "source_hash": 16473737525195994176,
      "context_hash": 7955768351093205166,
      "translation": "에이전트의 로그는 journald에 의해 전달되고 수집됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030576Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "To see them you can use journalctl:",
      "source_hash": 701752747279527638,
      "context_hash": 10619641270249465205,
      "translation": "로그를 확인하려면 journalctl을 사용할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030576Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Manually updating the container image",
      "source_hash": 15061752803935620286,
      "context_hash": 6398586827399051838,
      "translation": "컨테이너 이미지 수동 업데이트",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030576Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The container is updated automatically every 5 minutes (provided a newer image is present).",
      "source_hash": 255660273606241047,
      "context_hash": 198748948274219749,
      "translation": "컨테이너는 (더 새로운 이미지가 있는 경우) 5분마다 자동으로 업데이트됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030576Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "If you need to update them sooner you can manually start the updater service by running this command:",
      "source_hash": 18412433631594944178,
      "context_hash": 15323621634249790334,
      "translation": "더 빨리 업데이트해야 하는 경우, 다음 명령을 실행하여 업데이터 서비스를 수동으로 시작할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:39:55.030576Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
